OL,3,GNEWSAInflation and government borrowing
OL,4,Ahit highest level for a year ahead of
OL,5,Anext week's Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn next week's Budget, Chancellor John
OL,8,FHealey is likely to have little extra
OL,9,Fspare cash to provide "breathing space"
OL,10,Ffor households, says our deputy
OL,11,Feconomics editor
OL,13,FToday's rate will be used as a
OL,14,Fbenchmark for an increase in benefits
OL,15,Fcome next April - find out more here
OL,17,FInflation measures the increase in the
OL,18,Fprice of something over time - the Bank
OL,19,Fof England has a target of keeping the
OL,20,Frate at 2%
